.TH "LINTO-INSTALL" 1

.SH "Installation and setup"
.PP
Add this checkout's \fBbin/\fP directory to your \fBPATH\fP, or run the setup helper to
configure the current user's shell:
.RS
.PP
.nf
linto\-linto\-setup
.fi
.RE
.PP
The helper supports Bash, Zsh, and Fish and can be run more than once\. To
configure shell completion and install the \fBlinto(1)\fP man page as well:
.RS
.PP
.nf
linto\-linto\-setup \-\-man
.fi
.RE
.PP
If \fBman linto\fP is not found, ensure your user man directory is included in
\fBMANPATH\fP\. Run \fBlinto\-linto\-build\-man \-\-help\fP for details\.
.PP
To set up Markdown\-viewer prerequisites, run:
.RS
.PP
.nf
linto linto mdsetup
.fi
.RE
.PP
This reports the configured available viewer and attempts to install \fBmdcat\fP
and \fBmandown\fP when needed\. It does not install every optional viewer\. Viewer
preference and ordering are configured with \fBmarkdown\-viewer\fP in \fBconfig\.yml\fP;
see Group and Markdown\-viewer configuration\.
.PP
You can also configure \fBPATH\fP manually:
.RS
.PP
.nf
export PATH="/path/to/linto/bin:$PATH"
.fi
.RE
.PP
Replace \fB/path/to/linto\fP with this checkout's actual location\. See
Shell completion and Markdown navigation for tab completion\.
